  "summary": {
    "en": "Mozambique's president has warned of a crackdown on illegal firearms as the government sets a December deadline for surrendering such weapons. Venâncio Mondlane reported the killing of another Anamola member in the province. Erik Prince's forces suffered a battlefield loss in Congo, with a former UFC fighter among the wounded, indicating the conflict's spillover. The insurgency remains lethal, with 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.",
